#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:82
msgid "Au commencement du livre de Job, il y eut un pari."
msgstr "At the beginning of the Book of Job, there was a wager."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:83
msgid "« Retire-lui tout, disait l'Accusateur, et il te maudira en face. »"
msgstr "“Take everything from him,” said the Accuser, “and he will curse you to your face.”"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:84
msgid "On lui a tout retiré. Il n'a pas maudit."
msgstr "Everything was taken from him. He did not curse."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:85
msgid "L'Accusateur a perdu."
msgstr "The Accuser lost."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:96
msgid "Perdre une fois, c'est une leçon."
msgstr "Losing once is a lesson."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:98
msgid "Je n'aime pas les leçons."
msgstr "I don't like lessons."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:99
msgid "Alors j'ai relevé la mise."
msgstr "So I raised the stakes."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:116
msgid "Trois âmes que le Ciel avait épargnées."
msgstr "Three souls that Heaven had spared."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:117
msgid "Un meurtrier qu'on n'a pas eu le droit de tuer."
msgstr "A murderer no one was allowed to kill."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:119
msgid "Un juste qu'on a brisé, puis recollé."
msgstr "A righteous man, broken and then mended."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:121
msgid "Un fuyard qu'on a laissé sortir du feu."
msgstr "A fugitive who was allowed to escape the fire."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:123
msgid "Ce qui n'a pas plié là-haut pliera ici. C'est tout le pari."
msgstr "What did not bend up there will bend down here. That is the whole wager."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:134
msgid "Ils mourront. Souvent."
msgstr "They will die. Often."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:135
msgid "Chaque fois, je les relèverai à ma Forge."
msgstr "Each time, I will raise them again at my Forge."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:136
msgid "Un pari trop facile ne prouve rien : je leur prêterai même des armes."
msgstr "A wager too easily won proves nothing: I will even lend them weapons."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:143
msgid "L'enfer n'a pas de portes. Il a des vagues."
msgstr "Hell has no gates. It has waves."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:144
msgid "Et tout au fond, dit-on, une clé qui n'ouvre rien de ce qu'on connaît."
msgstr "And at the very bottom, they say, a key that opens nothing anyone knows."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:158
msgid "Caïn, le Premier Sang."
msgstr "Cain, the First Blood."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:159
msgid "Quiconque le tuerait serait vengé sept fois : ainsi l'avait voulu le Ciel."
msgstr "Whoever killed him would be avenged sevenfold: so Heaven had willed it."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:160
msgid "Personne n'a jamais osé."
msgstr "No one ever dared."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:171
msgid "Des siècles à marcher. Les rois meurent, les villes meurent."
msgstr "Centuries of walking. Kings die, cities die."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:172
msgid "Moi, jamais."
msgstr "Not me. Never."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:173
msgid "On m'a interdit de mourir. Personne ne m'a interdit de descendre."
msgstr "I was forbidden to die. No one forbade me to go down."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:185
msgid "Le premier meurtrier vient frapper à ma porte. J'en suis presque ému."
msgstr "The first murderer comes knocking at my door. I am almost touched."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:187
msgid "Je ne viens pas pour toi. Je viens chercher une fin."
msgstr "I'm not here for you. I'm here for an ending."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:188
msgid "Gagne, et je te la donnerai."
msgstr "Win, and I will give you one."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:189
msgid "Perds, et tu recommenceras. Tu as l'habitude."
msgstr "Lose, and you start over. You're used to it."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:190
msgid "Montre-moi ce qu'il faut tuer."
msgstr "Show me what needs killing."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:199
msgid "Job, l'Éprouvé."
msgstr "Job, the Tested."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:200
msgid "On lui avait pris ses troupeaux, sa maison, ses enfants, et jusqu'à sa peau."
msgstr "They took his herds, his house, his children, and even his skin."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:201
msgid "Il n'avait pas maudit. On lui avait tout rendu."
msgstr "He did not curse. Everything was given back to him."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:211
msgid "Je me suis endormi chez moi. Mes filles riaient dans la cour."
msgstr "I fell asleep at home. My daughters were laughing in the courtyard."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:212
msgid "Je me suis réveillé ici."
msgstr "I woke up here."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:224
msgid "Bonjour, Job. Tu ne me reconnais pas ? Nous avons un passé commun."
msgstr "Hello, Job. You don't recognize me? We share a past."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:226
msgid "Qu'ai-je fait, cette fois ?"
msgstr "What have I done this time?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:227
msgid "Rien. C'est bien ce qui rend la chose intéressante."
msgstr "Nothing. That is exactly what makes it interesting."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:228
msgid "On m'a déjà tout pris une fois. Je sais comment ça se termine."
msgstr "Everything was taken from me once already. I know how this ends."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:229
msgid "Là-haut, oui. Ici, c'est moi qui écris la fin."
msgstr "Up there, yes. Down here, I write the ending."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:238
msgid "Loth, le Fuyard."
msgstr "Lot, the Fugitive."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:239
msgid "Quand le feu est tombé sur Sodome, il a couru sans se retourner."
msgstr "When fire fell on Sodom, he ran without looking back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:240
msgid "Derrière lui, sa femme s'est retournée. Elle est devenue sel."
msgstr "Behind him, his wife looked back. She became salt."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:253
msgid "Toute ma vie, j'ai fui. Et toute ma vie, j'ai eu ce sel sur les lèvres."
msgstr "All my life I've run. And all my life I've had that salt on my lips."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:254
msgid "On dit que son âme est tombée ici, avec la ville."
msgstr "They say her soul fell here, along with the city."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:266
msgid "Le seul homme qui a su ne pas regarder en arrière…"
msgstr "The one man who knew not to look back…"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:268
msgid "… revient chercher ce qu'il a laissé derrière lui."
msgstr "… comes back for what he left behind."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:269 scripts/story/story_db.gd:495 scripts/story/story_db.gd:586
msgid "Où est-elle ?"
msgstr "Where is she?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:270
msgid "En bas. Tout en bas. Cours, Loth. Tu sais faire."
msgstr "Down. All the way down. Run, Lot. You know how."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:271
msgid "Cette fois, je ne fuis pas. Je descends."
msgstr "This time I'm not running. I'm going down."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:375 scripts/story/story_db.gd:418 scripts/story/story_db.gd:462
msgid "La Première Nuit est tombée."
msgstr "The First Night has fallen."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:376 scripts/story/story_db.gd:419 scripts/story/story_db.gd:463
msgid "En enfer, rien ne meurt tout à fait."
msgstr "In hell, nothing dies completely."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:389
msgid "Le premier meurtrier. Nous aurions dû nous rencontrer plus tôt, toi et moi."
msgstr "The first murderer. We should have met sooner, you and I."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:390
msgid "Relève-toi ou reste à terre. Mais ne me fais pas perdre mon temps."
msgstr "Get up or stay down. But don't waste my time."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:391
msgid "Ton temps ? Tu en as plus que quiconque. C'est ta malédiction, pas la mienne."
msgstr "Your time? You have more of it than anyone. That's your curse, not mine."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:392
msgid "Il t'a promis une fin, n'est-ce pas ? Il la promet à tous."
msgstr "He promised you an ending, didn't he? He promises it to everyone."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:393
msgid "Et alors ?"
msgstr "So?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:394
msgid "Ta Marque ne vient pas de lui. Ce qu'il n'a pas posé, il ne peut pas l'ôter."
msgstr "Your Mark doesn't come from him. What he didn't place, he cannot remove."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:406
msgid "Alors qui le peut ?"
msgstr "Then who can?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:407
msgid "Celui qui ne répond plus."
msgstr "The one who no longer answers."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:408
msgid "Personne n'a accepté son pari, Caïn. Il parie seul, contre un Ciel qui se tait."
msgstr "No one accepted his wager, Cain. He bets alone, against a silent Heaven."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:409
msgid "Alors je descendrai jusqu'à ce que quelqu'un réponde."
msgstr "Then I'll go down until someone answers."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:432
msgid "Job. L'homme qui n'a jamais dit non."
msgstr "Job. The man who never said no."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:433
msgid "J'ai dit beaucoup de choses. On ne les a pas toutes écrites."
msgstr "I said many things. Not all of them were written down."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:434
msgid "Moi, j'ai dit non. Une seule fois, au premier jardin. On m'a chassée pour ça."
msgstr "I said no. Just once, in the first garden. I was cast out for it."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:435
msgid "Toi, on t'a tout pris, et tu as remercié."
msgstr "They took everything from you, and you gave thanks."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:436
msgid "Je n'ai pas remercié. J'ai attendu une réponse."
msgstr "I didn't give thanks. I waited for an answer."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:437
msgid "Et elle est venue ?"
msgstr "And did it come?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:438
msgid "Du milieu d'une tempête. Elle ne répondait à rien de ce que j'avais demandé."
msgstr "Out of the middle of a storm. It answered nothing I had asked."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:450
msgid "Alors écoute celle-ci. Là-haut, personne n'a tenu le pari. Il joue seul."
msgstr "Then hear this one. Up there, no one took the wager. He plays alone."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:451
msgid "Tu souffres pour un adversaire qui ne regarde même pas."
msgstr "You suffer for an opponent who isn't even watching."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:452
msgid "Je n'ai jamais souffert pour lui."
msgstr "I never suffered for him."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:453
msgid "Mais maintenant, je sais à qui poser la question."
msgstr "But now I know who to ask."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:476
msgid "Le fuyard. Tu cours moins vite qu'à Sodome."
msgstr "The fugitive. You run slower than you did at Sodom."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:477
msgid "Ma femme. Tu l'as vue ?"
msgstr "My wife. Have you seen her?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:478
msgid "Je vois toutes celles qu'on a punies d'avoir regardé."
msgstr "I see every woman who was punished for looking."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:479
msgid "Tu crois qu'elle s'est retournée par curiosité ? Tes filles aînées étaient restées dans la ville."
msgstr "You think she looked back out of curiosity? Your elder daughters had stayed in the city."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:480
msgid "… Je le sais."
msgstr "… I know."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:481
msgid "Tu le savais, et tu as couru quand même. Elle, elle s'est retournée."
msgstr "You knew, and you ran anyway. She looked back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:496
msgid "Plus bas. Toujours plus bas."
msgstr "Lower. Always lower."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:497
msgid "Et sache ceci, fuyard : ce pari, personne là-haut ne l'a accepté. Il joue seul."
msgstr "And know this, fugitive: no one up there accepted this wager. He plays alone."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:498
msgid "Il ne te la rendra pas. Il n'a personne à qui prouver quoi que ce soit."
msgstr "He won't give her back to you. He has no one to prove anything to."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:499
msgid "Alors je ne lui demanderai pas. J'irai la prendre."
msgstr "Then I won't ask him. I'll go and take her."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:701 scripts/story/story_db.gd:725 scripts/story/story_db.gd:749
msgid "Le fond de l'enfer n'a pas de fond."
msgstr "The bottom of hell has no bottom."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:702 scripts/story/story_db.gd:726 scripts/story/story_db.gd:750
msgid "Il a une salle, et quelqu'un qui attend."
msgstr "It has a hall, and someone waiting."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:713
msgid "Caïn. Tu as traversé mon enfer pour une fin que je t'ai promise."
msgstr "Cain. You crossed my hell for an ending I promised you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:714
msgid "Lilith dit que tu ne peux pas me la donner."
msgstr "Lilith says you can't give it to me."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:715
msgid "Lilith a toujours eu un faible pour ceux qu'on chasse."
msgstr "Lilith always had a soft spot for the cast out."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:716
msgid "Alors prouve-lui qu'elle a tort."
msgstr "Then prove her wrong."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:717
msgid "Viens. On verra bien lequel de nous deux tombe."
msgstr "Come. We'll see which of us falls."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:737
msgid "Te voilà, Job. Sans troupeaux, sans maison, sans rien. Comme la première fois."
msgstr "There you are, Job. No herds, no house, nothing. Just like the first time."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:738
msgid "Tu joues seul. Lilith me l'a dit."
msgstr "You play alone. Lilith told me."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:739
msgid "Et pourtant tu es venu jusqu'ici. Pour qui, sinon pour moi ?"
msgstr "And yet you came all this way. For whom, if not for me?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:740
msgid "Pour la question. Pourquoi moi ?"
msgstr "For the question. Why me?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:741
msgid "Parce que tu n'as pas plié. Je ne supporte pas ce qui ne plie pas."
msgstr "Because you didn't bend. I cannot stand what does not bend."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:761
msgid "Le fuyard ne fuit plus. Que cherches-tu, si près du feu ?"
msgstr "The fugitive runs no more. What are you looking for, so close to the fire?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:762
msgid "Tu le sais."
msgstr "You know."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:763
msgid "Elle est derrière moi. Il te suffirait de ne pas te retourner, cette fois encore."
msgstr "She is behind me. All you would have to do is not look back, once again."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:764
msgid "Je ne vais pas me retourner. Je vais passer."
msgstr "I'm not going to look back. I'm going through."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:778
msgid "Assez… Tu la veux, ta fin ? Prends-la."
msgstr "Enough… You want your ending? Take it."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:779
msgid "Sur le front de Caïn, la Marque pâlit."
msgstr "On Cain's brow, the Mark fades."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:780
msgid "Pour la première fois depuis Abel, son cœur recommence à compter les battements."
msgstr "For the first time since Abel, his heart starts counting its beats again."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:781
msgid "Enfin. Je peux mourir."
msgstr "At last. I can die."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:782
msgid "Pas tout de suite. Mais je peux."
msgstr "Not right away. But I can."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:795
msgid "Tu veux ta réponse ? La voici."
msgstr "You want your answer? Here it is."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:796
msgid "Il n'y avait pas de raison. Il n'y en a jamais eu."
msgstr "There was no reason. There never was."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:533 scripts/story/story_db.gd:797
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:798
msgid "Alors je n'ai plus de question."
msgstr "Then I have no more questions."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:799
msgid "Pour la première fois depuis la tempête, Job ne demande plus rien. Et il se tient droit."
msgstr "For the first time since the storm, Job asks for nothing. And he stands tall."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:813
msgid "Derrière le trône, une statue de sel, tournée vers une ville qui n'existe plus."
msgstr "Behind the throne, a statue of salt, turned toward a city that no longer exists."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:814
msgid "Je suis revenu."
msgstr "I came back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:815
msgid "Le sel se fend. Sous la croûte blanche, une main tiède."
msgstr "The salt cracks. Beneath the white crust, a warm hand."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:816
msgid "Tu t'es retourné."
msgstr "You looked back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:817
msgid "Cette fois, oui."
msgstr "This time, yes."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:830
msgid "Tu croyais que la lumière s'éteignait si facilement ?"
msgstr "Did you think light went out so easily?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:831
msgid "Avant d'être Lucifer, j'étais autre chose. Et ce que j'étais ne meurt pas."
msgstr "Before I was Lucifer, I was something else. And what I was does not die."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:832
msgid "Trois sceaux me tiennent loin de ce que j'étais. Tu viens d'en briser un."
msgstr "Three seals keep me from what I was. You have just broken one."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:838
msgid "Un sceau se brise.  Sceaux brisés : {sceaux} / 3."
msgstr "A seal breaks.  Seals broken: {sceaux} / 3."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:839
msgid "Il en reste {reste}. J'ai l'éternité, et vous n'êtes que trois."
msgstr "{reste} remain. I have eternity, and there are only three of you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:840
msgid "L'enfer sans fin s'ouvre devant vous."
msgstr "Endless hell opens before you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:841
msgid "Le dernier vient de céder. Le portail est ouvert."
msgstr "The last one has just given way. The portal is open."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:842
msgid "Venez donc voir qui j'étais."
msgstr "Come and see who I was."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:857
msgid "Avant la chute, il portait la lumière du matin."
msgstr "Before the fall, he carried the morning light."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:858
msgid "Isaïe l'appelait Hélel, fils de l'Aurore. Rome a traduit : Lucifer."
msgstr "Isaiah called him Helel, son of the Dawn. Rome translated: Lucifer."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:871
msgid "Hélel. C'est ainsi qu'on m'appelait, quand on m'appelait encore."
msgstr "Helel. That is what they called me, when they still called me."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:872
msgid "Les trois sceaux brisés vous ont liés. Là où vous entrez, vous entrez ensemble."
msgstr "The three broken seals have bound you together. Where you enter, you enter as one."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:873
msgid "Trois âmes, un seul corps pour passer. Qu'importe."
msgstr "Three souls, only one body to pass through. No matter."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:874
msgid "Je vous prendrai l'un après l'autre, dans le désordre."
msgstr "I will take you one after another, in no particular order."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:889
msgid "Le Ciel… ne regardait pas."
msgstr "Heaven… was not watching."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:890
msgid "Non. Mais nous, si."
msgstr "No. But we were."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:891
msgid "Tu as perdu ton pari. Deux fois, maintenant."
msgstr "You lost your wager. Twice now."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:892
msgid "Et personne ne s'est retourné pour te voir tomber."
msgstr "And no one looked back to watch you fall."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:898
msgid "Le Pari est rompu."
msgstr "The Wager is broken."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:899
msgid "Ce que devient un enfer sans parieur, personne ne le sait encore."
msgstr "What becomes of a hell without a gambler, no one knows yet."

