#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:21
msgid "Les plus petits de l'enfer. Ils ne savent faire qu'une chose : venir."
msgstr "The smallest things in hell. They only know how to do one thing: come at you."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:24
msgid "Il a senti ta peur avant de te voir."
msgstr "It smelled your fear before it saw you."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:27
msgid "Il prie encore, par habitude, un dieu qui ne vient pas."
msgstr "He still prays, out of habit, to a god who never comes."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:30
msgid "On l'a nourrie de tout ce qui ne servait plus."
msgstr "It was fed everything nobody needed anymore."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:33
msgid "Ni le feu ni la pierre ne l'arrêtent."
msgstr "Neither fire nor stone can stop it."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:36
msgid "La lave a appris à ramper."
msgstr "The lava learned to crawl."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:39
msgid "Une âme égarée qui cherche quelqu'un avec qui brûler."
msgstr "A lost soul looking for someone to burn with."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:42
msgid "Il ne cligne jamais. Il attend que tu t'arrêtes."
msgstr "It never blinks. It waits for you to stop."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:45
msgid "Elle appelle, et l'enfer répond toujours."
msgstr "She calls, and hell always answers."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:50
msgid "Le Mont du Crâne : les os de ceux qui ont joué avant toi."
msgstr "The Mount of the Skull: the bones of those who played before you."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:53
msgid "La première femme. Elle a dit non, une fois."
msgstr "The first woman. She said no, once."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:56
msgid "Un dieu qu'on a cessé de prier. Il tonne encore."
msgstr "A god nobody prays to anymore. He still thunders."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:59
msgid "Trois têtes, et la chaîne de Salomon."
msgstr "Three heads, and Solomon's chain."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:62
msgid "Il a parié, et il a perdu. Il ne l'a pas accepté."
msgstr "He made a wager, and he lost. He never accepted it."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:66
msgid "Le nom d'avant la chute. Fils de l'Aurore."
msgstr "The name from before the fall. Son of the Dawn."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:22
msgid "Seul, rien. En meute, tout."
msgstr "Alone, nothing. In a pack, everything."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:25
msgid "Il se fige avant de charger, et sa charge ne dévie pas : un pas de côté suffit."
msgstr "It freezes before it charges, and the charge never turns: one step aside is enough."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:28
msgid "Il recule quand on l'approche, mais s'arrête pour tirer : c'est là qu'on le rattrape."
msgstr "He backs away when you close in, but stops to shoot: that's when you catch him."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:31
msgid "Lente, mais elle frappe deux fois plus fort qu'un imp. Ne la laisse pas t'acculer."
msgstr "Slow, but it hits twice as hard as an imp. Don't let it corner you."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:34
msgid "Elle vole : se cacher derrière le décor ne sert à rien. Elle tombe au premier tir."
msgstr "It flies: hiding behind the scenery won't help. One shot brings it down."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:37
msgid "Tué, il se divise en deux. Ce qui traverse ou qui brûle en vient à bout."
msgstr "Killed, it splits in two. Piercing and burning make short work of it."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:40
msgid "Abats-le pendant sa mèche, et rien n'explose. S'il détone, il ne rapporte rien."
msgstr "Kill it while its fuse burns and nothing explodes. If it detonates, it pays nothing."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:43
msgid "Il se fige pour viser, puis son rayon se verrouille : fonce sur lui pendant qu'il vise."
msgstr "It freezes to aim, then its beam locks on: rush it while it aims."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:46
msgid "Ses imps tombent en cendre avec elle, et ne rapportent rien. Vise-la d'abord."
msgstr "Her imps crumble to ash with her, and pay nothing. Aim for her first."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:51
msgid "Lent, mais c'est le sol qui frappe. S'éloigner ne fait qu'appeler les croix."
msgstr "Slow, but the ground does the hitting. Keeping away only calls the crosses."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:54
msgid "Elle disparaît, puis surgit sur toi avec sa progéniture. Garde-la sous le feu."
msgstr "She vanishes, then appears on top of you with her brood. Keep her under fire."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:57
msgid "Chaque cercle bleu est un éclair qui va tomber. Rester loin ne protège de rien."
msgstr "Every blue circle is a bolt about to fall. Distance protects you from nothing."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:60
msgid "Chaque tête a son attaque. Sa chaîne te tire vers lui avant de charger."
msgstr "Each head has its own attack. His chain drags you to him before he charges."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:63
msgid "Son cercle de feu s'allume à la distance où tu te tiens. Le seul endroit sûr est près de lui."
msgstr "His ring of fire ignites at whatever distance you stand. The only safe place is close to him."

#: scripts/story/bestiaire.gd:67
msgid "Trois âmes, un seul corps : il te fait changer de damné en plein combat."
msgstr "Three souls, one body: he makes you switch damned mid-fight."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:16
msgid "Le premier pari"
msgstr "The first wager"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:19
msgid "Ceux d'avant"
msgstr "Those before"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:25
msgid "La question"
msgstr "The question"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:28
msgid "La statue"
msgstr "The statue"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:31
msgid "Celle qui a refusé"
msgstr "The one who refused"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:34
msgid "Les dieux qu'on oublie"
msgstr "Forgotten gods"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:37
msgid "La chaîne"
msgstr "The chain"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:40
msgid "La Forge"
msgstr "The Forge"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:43
msgid "La Clé"
msgstr "The Key"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:46
msgid "L'Aurore"
msgstr "The Dawn"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:49
msgid "La dernière page"
msgstr "The last page"

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:17
msgid "Terminer une première descente."
msgstr "Finish a first descent."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:20
msgid "Abattre Golgota."
msgstr "Slay Golgota."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:23
msgid "Abattre Lilith avec Caïn."
msgstr "Slay Lilith with Cain."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:26
msgid "Abattre Lilith avec Job."
msgstr "Slay Lilith with Job."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:29
msgid "Abattre Lilith avec Loth."
msgstr "Slay Lilith with Lot."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:32
msgid "Abattre Lilith."
msgstr "Slay Lilith."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:35
msgid "Abattre Baal."
msgstr "Slay Baal."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:38
msgid "Abattre Asmodée."
msgstr "Slay Asmodeus."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:41
msgid "Ouvrir 10 nœuds de Forge."
msgstr "Open 10 Forge nodes."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:44
msgid "Ramasser la Clé des Abysses."
msgstr "Pick up the Key of the Abyss."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:47
msgid "Briser les trois sceaux."
msgstr "Break the three seals."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:50
msgid "Rompre le Pari."
msgstr "Break the Wager."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:18
msgid ""
"« Retire-lui tout, ai-je dit, et il te maudira en face. »\n"
"\n"
"On lui a tout retiré. Il s'est assis dans la cendre et il a gratté ses plaies avec un tesson. Il a crié, il a douté, il a exigé des comptes.\n"
"\n"
"Il n'a pas maudit. J'ai perdu contre un homme assis dans la cendre. Je n'ai jamais perdu ailleurs."
msgstr ""
"\"Take everything from him,\" I said, \"and he will curse you to your face.\"\n"
"\n"
"Everything was taken from him. He sat down in the ashes and scraped his sores with a shard of pottery. He cried out, he doubted, he demanded an accounting.\n"
"\n"
"He did not curse. I lost to a man sitting in the ashes. I have never lost anywhere else."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:21
msgid ""
"Coré, englouti avec les siens. Les bâtisseurs de Babel, tous. Une femme de Gomorrhe dont je n'ai pas gardé le nom.\n"
"\n"
"(Chaque nom est raturé.)\n"
"\n"
"Ils ont plié. Je les ai rangés en tas, et le tas s'est mis à marcher. Les damnés l'appellent Golgota. Moi, je l'appelle mes archives."
msgstr ""
"Korah, swallowed up with his own. The builders of Babel, all of them. A woman of Gomorrah whose name I did not keep.\n"
"\n"
"(Every name is crossed out.)\n"
"\n"
"They bent. I stacked them in a heap, and the heap began to walk. The damned call it Golgota. I call it my archives."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:24
msgid ""
"Sept fois vengé, quiconque le tuerait. Je l'ai lue, retournée, éprouvée au feu : elle ne cède pas.\n"
"\n"
"C'est la seule chose de mon enfer que je n'ai pas faite, et elle se promène devant moi sur le front d'un meurtrier.\n"
"\n"
"Je lui ai promis une fin. Je ne sais pas comment la lui donner. Il ne doit pas le savoir."
msgstr ""
"Whoever kills him shall be avenged sevenfold. I have read it, turned it over, tried it in the fire: it does not yield.\n"
"\n"
"It is the only thing in my hell I did not make, and it walks before me on a murderer's brow.\n"
"\n"
"I promised him an end. I do not know how to give it to him. He must not find out."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:27
msgid ""
"Les autres demandent pourquoi eux. Lui demande pourquoi. Pas pourquoi lui : pourquoi tout.\n"
"\n"
"Je n'ai pas de réponse. Personne n'en a, et c'est ce qui rend la question dangereuse.\n"
"\n"
"S'il la pose assez fort, ici, quelqu'un finira par l'entendre. Ce ne sera pas moi."
msgstr ""
"The others ask why them. He asks why. Not why him: why anything.\n"
"\n"
"I have no answer. No one does, and that is what makes the question dangerous.\n"
"\n"
"If he asks it loudly enough, down here, someone will end up hearing it. It will not be me."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:30
msgid ""
"Elle est tombée avec la ville, tournée vers elle. Je l'ai ramassée dans les cendres de Sodome et posée derrière mon trône.\n"
"\n"
"Ce n'est pas de la cruauté. C'est un appât.\n"
"\n"
"Un homme qui n'a jamais regardé en arrière finira bien par venir regarder devant."
msgstr ""
"She fell with the city, still facing it. I picked her up from the ashes of Sodom and set her behind my throne.\n"
"\n"
"It is not cruelty. It is bait.\n"
"\n"
"A man who never once looked back will come, sooner or later, to look ahead."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:33
msgid ""
"Lilith. La seule à qui j'ai proposé de parier avec moi.\n"
"\n"
"Elle a ri : « Je ne joue pas aux jeux des autres. C'est pour ça qu'on m'a chassée. »\n"
"\n"
"Je l'ai gardée ici quand même. On ne laisse pas partir la seule qui sait qu'on joue seul."
msgstr ""
"Lilith. The only one I ever asked to wager with me.\n"
"\n"
"She laughed: \"I don't play other people's games. That's why they drove me out.\"\n"
"\n"
"I kept her here anyway. You do not let go of the only one who knows you play alone."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:36
msgid ""
"Baal avait des autels sur toutes les collines. Puis un prophète a dressé un bûcher sur le Carmel, et le feu n'est pas venu pour lui.\n"
"\n"
"On a cessé de le prier. Un dieu qu'on ne prie plus ne meurt pas : il tombe. Ici.\n"
"\n"
"Je les ramasse tous. Ils font de bons gardiens : ils ont l'habitude de ne pas répondre."
msgstr ""
"Baal had altars on every hill. Then a prophet built a pyre on Carmel, and the fire did not come for him.\n"
"\n"
"People stopped praying to him. A god no one prays to does not die: he falls. Here.\n"
"\n"
"I gather them all. They make good guards: they are used to not answering."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:39
msgid ""
"Salomon l'avait enchaîné pour bâtir son Temple. Salomon est mort, la chaîne est restée.\n"
"\n"
"Asmodée sert qui la tient. Aujourd'hui, c'est moi.\n"
"\n"
"Je ne me fais pas d'illusions : le jour où un damné la ramassera, les trois têtes se tourneront vers lui."
msgstr ""
"Solomon chained him to build his Temple. Solomon died; the chain remained.\n"
"\n"
"Asmodeus serves whoever holds it. Today, that is me.\n"
"\n"
"I have no illusions: the day one of the damned picks it up, all three heads will turn toward him."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:42
msgid ""
"Ils croient que la Forge les rend plus forts. Elle les rend durables.\n"
"\n"
"Chaque nœud que j'y grave est fait de ce qu'ils ont perdu en route : une chute, une manche, un espoir.\n"
"\n"
"Un pari trop facile ne prouve rien. Un pari qu'on ne peut plus abandonner, si."
msgstr ""
"They think the Forge makes them stronger. It makes them last.\n"
"\n"
"Every node I carve into it is made of what they lost along the way: a fall, a round, a hope.\n"
"\n"
"A wager that is too easy proves nothing. A wager you can no longer walk away from does."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:45
msgid ""
"Je l'ai forgée le premier jour, et je l'ai cachée tout au fond.\n"
"\n"
"Un enfer sans sortie ne serait pas un pari, ce serait une prison. Et une prison ne prouve rien.\n"
"\n"
"Quelqu'un vient de la ramasser. Le pari est perdu, ou il commence à peine."
msgstr ""
"I forged it on the first day, and hid it at the very bottom.\n"
"\n"
"A hell with no way out would not be a wager, it would be a prison. And a prison proves nothing.\n"
"\n"
"Someone has just picked it up. Either the wager is lost, or it has barely begun."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:48
msgid ""
"Je ne m'appelais pas ainsi. Lucifer, c'est le mot d'un traducteur romain.\n"
"\n"
"Avant, il y avait un autre nom, et il voulait dire le matin.\n"
"\n"
"Trois sceaux le tenaient loin de moi. Ils ont cédé, et je m'en souviens. Je n'aurais pas dû."
msgstr ""
"That was not my name. Lucifer is a Roman translator's word.\n"
"\n"
"Before, there was another name, and it meant the morning.\n"
"\n"
"Three seals kept it away from me. They have given way, and I remember. I should not have."

#: scripts/story/registre.gd:51
msgid ""
"(Une page blanche. Une seule ligne, d'une écriture qui n'est pas la sienne.)\n"
"\n"
"« J'ai regardé. »"
msgstr ""
"(A blank page. A single line, in a hand that is not his.)\n"
"\n"
"\"I was watching.\""

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:285 scripts/story/story_db.gd:314 scripts/story/story_db.gd:342
msgid "Le Mont du Crâne s'est effondré."
msgstr "The Mount of the Skull has collapsed."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:286 scripts/story/story_db.gd:315 scripts/story/story_db.gd:343
msgid "Il ne se relèvera pas. Mais ce qui le tenait debout parle encore."
msgstr "It will not rise again. But what held it up still speaks."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:299
msgid "Toi aussi, il t'a promis une fin."
msgstr "He promised you an end too."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:300
msgid "Qui êtes-vous ?"
msgstr "Who are you?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:301
msgid "Ceux d'avant. Ceux qui ont joué avant toi."
msgstr "Those before. Those who played before you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:302
msgid "Combien ?"
msgstr "How many?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:303
msgid "Assez pour faire une montagne."
msgstr "Enough to make a mountain."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:304
msgid "Alors vous avez perdu."
msgstr "Then you lost."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:305
msgid "Nous avons cessé de nous relever. Ici, c'est la seule façon de perdre."
msgstr "We stopped getting back up. Down here, that is the only way to lose."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:328
msgid "« Cherche dans ton souvenir : quel innocent a jamais péri ? »"
msgstr "\"Remember, I pray thee: who ever perished, being innocent?\""

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:329
msgid "Éliphaz disait cela. Tu as ses mots, pas sa voix."
msgstr "Eliphaz used to say that. You have his words, not his voice."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:330
msgid "Nous avons tous eu des amis pour nous expliquer pourquoi nous souffrions."
msgstr "We all had friends to explain to us why we suffered."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:331
msgid "Nous les avons crus. Nous avons plié."
msgstr "We believed them. We bent."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:332
msgid "Moi, je ne les ai pas crus."
msgstr "I did not believe them."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:333
msgid "Alors continue de ne pas croire. C'est tout ce qui te tient debout."
msgstr "Then keep not believing. It is all that keeps you standing."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:356
msgid "Dix justes. Il en aurait fallu dix pour sauver la ville."
msgstr "Ten righteous men. Ten would have been enough to save the city."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:357
msgid "… Vous étiez de Sodome."
msgstr "… You were from Sodom."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:358
msgid "Tu ne nous as pas reconnus. Tu ne regardais pas en arrière."
msgstr "You didn't recognise us. You weren't looking back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:359
msgid "Ma femme est-elle parmi vous ?"
msgstr "Is my wife among you?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:360
msgid "Non. Elle n'a jamais cessé de se relever. Elle est plus bas."
msgstr "No. She never stopped getting back up. She is further down."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:513 scripts/story/story_db.gd:542 scripts/story/story_db.gd:569
msgid "L'orage s'est tu."
msgstr "The storm has gone quiet."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:514 scripts/story/story_db.gd:543 scripts/story/story_db.gd:570
msgid "Il ne reste qu'une voix qui gronde, de plus en plus bas."
msgstr "Only a voice remains, rumbling lower and lower."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:527
msgid "Agenouille-toi, et ma foudre te donnera ce que tu cherches."
msgstr "Kneel, and my lightning will give you what you seek."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:528
msgid "Ta foudre m'a traversé dix fois. Je suis encore debout."
msgstr "Your lightning went through me ten times. I am still standing."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:529
msgid "Sur le Carmel, mes prophètes m'ont appelé du matin jusqu'à midi. Je n'ai pas répondu."
msgstr "On Carmel, my prophets called on me from morning until noon. I did not answer."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:530
msgid "Pourquoi ?"
msgstr "Why?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:531
msgid "Je n'étais pas là. Quand on ne répond pas, c'est qu'on n'est pas là."
msgstr "I was not there. When you don't answer, it's because you are not there."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:532
msgid "… Ou qu'on écoute."
msgstr "… Or because you are listening."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:556
msgid "« Où étais-tu quand je fondais la terre ? »"
msgstr "\"Where wast thou when I laid the foundations of the earth?\""

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:557
msgid "Ces mots ne sont pas les tiens."
msgstr "Those words are not yours."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:558
msgid "Les mots appartiennent à qui tonne le plus fort."
msgstr "Words belong to whoever thunders loudest."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:559
msgid "Celui qui me les a dits n'avait pas besoin de la foudre pour que je l'entende."
msgstr "The one who said them to me did not need lightning for me to hear him."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:560
msgid "Tu es la tempête. Pas la voix."
msgstr "You are the storm. Not the voice."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:583
msgid "Le feu et le soufre sur ta ville. Tu t'en souviens ?"
msgstr "Fire and brimstone on your city. Do you remember?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:584
msgid "J'ai déjà vu le ciel tomber. Il ne m'a pas attendu."
msgstr "I have seen the sky fall before. It did not wait for me."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:585
msgid "Ta femme, elle, a regardé tomber le feu sans avoir peur. Elle cherchait deux visages."
msgstr "Your wife watched the fire fall without fear. She was looking for two faces."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:587
msgid "Plus bas. Chez celui qui garde ce qu'on regrette."
msgstr "Further down. With the one who keeps what people regret."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:601 scripts/story/story_db.gd:628 scripts/story/story_db.gd:655
msgid "Les trois têtes se sont tues."
msgstr "The three heads have fallen silent."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:602 scripts/story/story_db.gd:629 scripts/story/story_db.gd:656
msgid "Une seule parle encore."
msgstr "Only one still speaks."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:615
msgid "Je peux te donner ce que ta Marque t'interdit."
msgstr "I can give you what your Mark forbids you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:616
msgid "Une seule condition : une autre mort à la place de la tienne."
msgstr "One condition: another death in place of yours."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:617
msgid "Celle de qui ?"
msgstr "Whose?"

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:618
msgid "Qu'importe. Tu sais faire."
msgstr "What does it matter? You know how."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:619
msgid "C'est comme ça que tout a commencé. Non."
msgstr "That is how it all began. No."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:642
msgid "Le Ciel t'a rendu le double de tes troupeaux. Et d'autres enfants."
msgstr "Heaven gave you back twice your herds. And other children."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:643
msgid "D'autres."
msgstr "Other children."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:644
msgid "Moi, je peux te rendre les premiers."
msgstr "I can give you back the first ones."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:645
msgid "Ce ne serait pas eux. Ce serait toi, avec leurs visages."
msgstr "It would not be them. It would be you, wearing their faces."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:646
msgid "Je préfère une question sans réponse à une réponse fausse."
msgstr "I would rather have a question with no answer than a false answer."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:671
msgid "Elle est derrière toi."
msgstr "She is behind you."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:672
msgid "Retourne-toi, et elle est à toi."
msgstr "Turn around, and she is yours."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:673
msgid "Elle s'est retournée une fois, pour nos filles."
msgstr "She turned around once, for our daughters."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:674
msgid "Moi, je ne me retournerai pas pour moi."
msgstr "I will not turn around for my own sake."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:685
msgid "Loth avance. Il ne se retourne pas."
msgstr "Lot walks on. He does not look back."

#: scripts/story/story_db.gd:52
msgid "Les ossements"
msgstr "The bones"

